    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Balenciaga Le 7 line unveils a new bowling bag silhouette, whose standout feature is the nested 'bag-in-bag' construction: the central main compartment closes with a top zipper, while the outer leather sleeve fastens with the brand's signature turn-lock closure. This small version is rendered in rose quartz lambskin, paired with camel-colored lambskin lining and aged silver-tone hardware. The layered structure makes organizing items a breeze and adds a sense of surprise every time you open it.",
